Package: gnome-control-center
Version: @DEB_GCC_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: System
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gnome-control-center
Depends: libgtk-4-1, libadwaita-1-0, libgnome-desktop-4-2, gsettings-desktop-schemas, libcolord2, libaccountsservice0, libpolkit-gobject-1-0, libgcr-4-4, libpulse0, libupower-glib3, gnome-settings-daemon, dconf, xios-desktop-stublibs, libgtkintl
Description: GNOME Settings for the Xios desktop
 gnome-control-center 46 (GNOME Settings) built for rootless iOS. The
 config panels that make sense on a Wayland tablet are built (appearance/
 background, display, keyboard, mouse, sound, notifications, search,
 applications, privacy, universal access, power, search, sharing and sound);
 panels whose backends have no iOS implementation are compiled out: network
 and mobile (NetworkManager/ModemManager), printers (CUPS), online accounts
 (gnome-online-accounts) and wacom. The Bluetooth panel is an optional build
 (gnome-bluetooth) backed by the xios-bluez-stub org.bluez bridge. Built for
 iPadOS/iOS rootless (palera1n/Dopamine).
